# Independent GeoNames schema/cache review

No concrete blocking defect was found in the bounded implementation. Nine independent synthetic controls passed under Node 22.23.2 with strict unhandled-rejection handling. The result supports integrating this source follow-up subject to the integrator's normal gates; it is not human approval, a registry release, asset authentication or a full resource-exhaustion audit.

## Reviewed identity

- Reviewed source: `packages/engine/src/geo/geonames.ts` in the isolated GeoNames schema checkout; SHA256 `fd4363799fb26f3682b8c54054afc07761d7c301cdb798e6afc40965df150437`.
- The implementation owner confirmed source freeze before probing. The source hash was checked again afterward and was unchanged.
