- Baseline `git show HEAD:packages/engine/src/geo/geonames.ts` SHA256 `4872c94c5ccface076aa0dbab3f5c0209ed5e04d4f105d265cbc2844309f7f3a`.
- Independent `probe.mjs` SHA256 `75cabfde592f636ff0e0aa68738e21bd66105aec37387b8759f9e2f095f1e62e`.
